From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jordan Bettcher <thebettcher@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:06:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] [ppc64] runtime: object_ppc64_test.cc

The three code generators object_test.cc calls (GenerateIncrement,
GenerateEmbedStringInCode, GenerateEmbedSmiInCode): object_arm64_test.cc's
through the register bijection, written with the shared Assembler API.
---
 runtime/vm/object_ppc64_test.cc | 59 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 runtime/vm/vm_sources.gni       |  1 +
 2 files changed, 60 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 runtime/vm/object_ppc64_test.cc

diff --git a/runtime/vm/object_ppc64_test.cc b/runtime/vm/object_ppc64_test.cc
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..f83786a1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/runtime/vm/object_ppc64_test.cc
@@ -0,0 +1,59 @@
